{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>\r\n\t\t\t筲箕灣道路政署地盤工人，早上進行工程期間一條直徑18吋的地下食水管爆裂，要緊急停水。筲箕灣、西灣河一帶逾萬戶受影響。水務署初步相信與水管老化無關，希望午夜前恢復供水。路政署就對事故影響市民表示歉意，說會詳細調查原因。<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\r\n編輯：詹可揚\t\t</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-27T11:42:43.690544+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":115,"images":0,"source":"RTHK 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-27T11:17:52+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-27T13:58:52.877850+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-27T11:38:38.395538+00:00","content_hash":"eebf34178a37d74202371de823c618792cd583f32945b507a5bd1c813f08cfee","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}